"textdb:descriptions:the floor"
msgid ""
"The floor.\n"
msgstr ""
"Golvet.\n"

#. key: a rock wall
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a rock wall"
msgid ""
"A wall consisting of simple rock.\n"
msgstr ""
"Denna vägg består av enkel rock.\n"

#. key: a gravestone
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a gravestone"
msgid ""
"A nameless grave.\n"
msgstr ""
"En namnlös grav.\n"

#. key: a tempered metal wall
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a tempered metal wall"
msgid ""
"Walls of brass and nickel, covered in a thin golden foil steadily peeling away\n"
"in the constant, oppressive heat. Designs depict mortals dealing with devils,\n"
"but the former rarely seem to come out ahead on the exchange.\n"
msgstr ""
"Denna metallvägg avger värme.\n"

#. key: a silver wall
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a silver wall"
msgid ""
"A wall made of pure silver.\n"
msgstr ""
"Denna vägg är gjord av rent silver.\n"

